設，簟為夏施，揖讓而坐，君子攸宜。」異賦弩曰：「南嶽之幹，鍾山之銅，應機命中，獲隼高墉。」三人各隨其目所見而賦之，皆成而後坐，據大歡悅。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01:m0010","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01:m0007"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-wu059-he-2","subject_person_id":"16y_k92_fmm_A","object_person_id":"16y_k92_fmm","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"敦之子"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-059","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-059-he","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line028-pei01-01","quote":"《吳書》曰：和少岐嶷有智意，故權尤愛幸，常在左右，衣服禮秩雕玩珍異之賜，諸子莫得比焉。好文學，善騎射，承師涉學，精識聦敏，尊敬師傅，愛好人物。穎等每朝見進賀，和常降意，歡以待之。講校經義，綜察是非，及訪諮朝臣，考績行能，以知優劣，各有條貫。後諸葛壹僞叛以誘魏將諸葛誕，權潛軍待之。和以權暴露外次，又戰者凶事，常憂勞憯怛，不復會同飲食，數上諫，戒令持重，務在全勝，權還，然後敢安。張純字元基，敦之子。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line028-pei01-01:m0189","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-059-he:line028-pei01-01:m0195"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-wu052-gs-dun","person_id":"16y_k92_fmm","event_type":"death","source_term":"年三十二卒","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei01-01","quote":"吴录曰：敦字叔方，静字玄风，并吴郡人。敦德量渊懿，清虚淡泊，又善文辞。孙权为车骑将军，辟西曹掾，转主簿，出补海昬令，甚有惠化，年三十二卒。卜静终於剡令。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048-pei01-01:m0004"}],"interpretation_note":"依本來源登記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"age_assertions":[{