{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01","text":"《文士傳》曰：張惇子純與張儼及異俱童少，往見驃騎將軍朱據。據聞三人才名，欲試之，告曰：「老鄙相聞，饑渴甚矣。夫騕褭以迅驟為功，鷹隼以輕疾為妙，其為吾各賦一物，然後乃坐。」儼乃賦犬曰：「守則有威，出則有獲，韓盧、宋鵲，書名竹帛。」純賦席曰：「席以冬設，簟為夏施，揖讓而坐，君子攸宜。」異賦弩曰：「南嶽之幹，鍾山之銅，應機命中，獲隼高墉。」三人各隨其目所見而賦之，皆成而後坐，據大歡悅。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"張惇","kind":"person","person_id":"16y_k92_fmm","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"純","kind":"person","person_id":"16y_k92_fmm_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"張儼","kind":"person","person_id":"1p0_b3p_e5e","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"異","kind":"person","person_id":"r7q_ie6_ud9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"朱據","kind":"person","person_id":"ejj_vdz_hxw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01:m0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"據","kind":"person","person_id":"ejj_vdz_hxw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01:m0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"儼","kind":"person","person_id":"1p0_b3p_e5e","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01:m0114","start":114,"end":115,"surface":"純","kind":"person","person_id":"16y_k92_fmm_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuyi:line072-pei01-01:m0141","start":141,"end":142,"